          "row": 6,
          "col": 1,
          "html": "Whether to use TLS encryption:<ul><li>yes - sends STARTTLS and drops the session if TLS is not available on the server</li><li>no - does not send STARTTLS</li><li>starttls - sends STARTTLS and continues without TLS if a server responds that TLS is not available</li></ul>"
        }
      ]
    },
